# Copy to .env.production and build: `npm run build:admin`.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_* value into the bundle at build time, so this file
# decides which environment the artifact belongs to. A build is not promotable
# between environments — build once per target.
#
# Neither value is a secret; both ship in the JavaScript by design.

# Vegetable.API root. Trailing slash required — the client joins paths onto it.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.busycarrot.com/

# The public booking site. Used to show an owner their own URL.
VITE_OBS_BASE_URL=https://busycarrot.com/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Auth0 is gone, and so is the dev bypass that existed because of it
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Admin authenticates against `users/authenticate` — phone number, verification
# call, then the API's own ten-year bearer token. There is no tenant to
# configure, no callback URL to register, and no client id to keep in step.
#
# The old VITE_DEV_BYPASS_AUTH / VITE_DEV_API_TOKEN pair is also gone. It
# existed because Auth0's checkSession hangs rather than fails when it cannot
# reach a tenant, which made the app impossible to open locally. Signing in for
# real now works against a local API, so there is nothing left to bypass.
